    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Mara (30 ani), este vraciul unui sat de pescari din Delta Dun\u0103rii, folosindu-se de un n\u0103mol special pentru a trata s\u0103tenii. C\u00e2nd Mara r\u0103mane gravid\u0103 \u0219i poveste\u0219te s\u0103tenilor c\u0103 sarcina se datoreaz\u0103 n\u0103molului \u0219i nu unui om, s\u0103tenii o acuz\u0103 de vr\u0103jitorie \u0219i o alung\u0103. Ascunz\u00e2ndu-\u0219i sarcina, reu\u0219e\u0219te s\u0103 \u00ee\u0219i g\u0103seasc\u0103 ceva de munc\u0103 \u00eentr-un hotel \u00een zona lacului Tekirghiol, care func\u021bioneaz\u0103 ca o clinic\u0103 \u0219i centru SPA pentru oameni \u00eenst\u0103ri\u021bi, unde o \u00eent\u00e2lne\u0219te pe Lili, unul dintre clien\u021bii hotelului, o femeie bogat\u0103 \u0219i frumoas\u0103 care \u00eencearc\u0103 cu \u00eenver\u0219unare s\u0103 g\u0103seasc\u0103 o solu\u021bie pentru problema infertilit\u0103\u021bii ei. Treptat, trecutul \u0219i natura femeii misterioase iese la iveal\u0103, iar Mara \u0219i copilul ei se afl\u0103 \u00een pericol.",
        "english": "The film tells, like a fable, the struggle of a young woman to protect her unborn child which she believes is a miracle, an immaculate conception."
